WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.958 --> 01:47.160
=Episode 21=
(Now I Only Have You)

01:48.382 --> 01:49.821
Home is still the best.

01:50.141 --> 01:51.141
Right?

01:51.261 --> 01:52.422
Clean up.

01:52.862 --> 01:54.342
In a while, Mr. Cai and Yingying

01:54.422 --> 01:55.422
will come to have a meal.

01:55.661 --> 01:56.701
Yingying is on vacation?

01:56.821 --> 01:57.821
No.

01:58.022 --> 01:58.781
She aced art exam.

01:58.902 --> 02:00.422
She's attending review classes.

02:00.621 --> 02:01.423
Logically speaking,

02:01.503 --> 02:02.822
she'd be studying hard at home.

02:02.902 --> 02:04.341
Heard you were back.

02:04.582 --> 02:05.462
Mr. Cai

02:05.542 --> 02:06.462
gave her a day off.

02:06.542 --> 02:07.101
Xu Zhi.

02:07.181 --> 02:07.423
Good.

02:07.503 --> 02:08.701
I'm here.

02:09.221 --> 02:10.261
So fast.

02:10.382 --> 02:11.621
I just mentioned you.

02:13.141 --> 02:14.741
I miss you so much.

02:16.422 --> 02:18.141
Didn't we just meet two weeks ago?

02:18.221 --> 02:19.661
I just miss you.

02:19.741 --> 02:21.502
Let's go. Hurry up. Go inside.

02:21.982 --> 02:23.101
You're shaking me to pieces.

02:23.181 --> 02:24.301
Clothes.

02:24.902 --> 02:26.022
Help me take them.

02:26.382 --> 02:27.821
Hang them and help.

02:29.261 --> 02:30.261
The young one orders me.

02:30.382 --> 02:31.141
So do you.

02:31.221 --> 02:32.221
Chop the vegetables!

02:32.382 --> 02:32.902
Alright.

02:32.982 --> 02:33.982
Right away.

02:40.502 --> 02:41.502
I forgot to ask you.

02:42.341 --> 02:43.741
I noticed your daughter

02:43.862 --> 02:44.862
is much thinner.

02:44.942 --> 02:46.141
Is it because she missed you

02:46.582 --> 02:47.661
out of town?

02:50.181 --> 02:52.422
Three calls a day.

02:52.582 --> 02:55.221
She's worried I don't eat well
and dress warmly at home.

02:55.301 --> 02:55.821
Look,

02:56.181 --> 02:58.422
she bought me
this pure wool home outfit.

02:59.062 --> 03:00.741
It's really warm to wear.

03:00.821 --> 03:02.782
Isn't the padded jacket you wore

03:02.862 --> 03:04.342
a bit drafty now?

03:04.422 --> 03:05.422
Stop it.

03:06.102 --> 03:07.141
Yingying now

03:07.221 --> 03:08.221
is well-behaved.

03:08.422 --> 03:09.382
Now whoever calls,

03:09.462 --> 03:10.502
she just won't go out.

03:11.542 --> 03:13.141
Recently, in the mock exam,

03:13.701 --> 03:14.622
she got 120 in Chinese

03:14.702 --> 03:15.661
and 110 for Math.

03:15.741 --> 03:17.462
The scores shot up quickly.

03:17.542 --> 03:18.741
I couldn't stop it.

03:18.821 --> 03:19.862
If it keeps going,

03:20.221 --> 03:21.982
getting into
is Huaguang University is easy.

03:22.062 --> 03:23.141
It would be lucky

03:23.221 --> 03:24.382
to have us.

03:24.582 --> 03:25.582
Yes.

03:25.942 --> 03:28.701
Yingying has been a smart child
since childhood.

03:29.382 --> 03:30.382
Was she

03:30.582 --> 03:32.221
spoiled by you?

03:35.542 --> 03:37.061
By the way,

03:37.141 --> 03:39.221
you and Ms. Wei lately...

03:42.542 --> 03:43.782
Zhi's sensitive.

03:43.862 --> 03:45.942
I haven't mentioned it to her yet.

03:46.022 --> 03:47.141
I just wanted

03:47.301 --> 03:48.541
to let her

03:48.621 --> 03:49.862
focus wholeheartedly

03:49.942 --> 03:50.942
on studying.

03:51.621 --> 03:52.621
This matter

03:52.902 --> 03:53.902
can be mentioned later.

03:54.462 --> 03:56.102
Don't let it slip later.

03:56.542 --> 03:57.782
It would affect her mood.

03:57.862 --> 03:59.022
Alright, I got it.

03:59.341 --> 04:01.022
Zhi, it's only been two weeks.

04:01.102 --> 04:02.342
How did you lose weight?

04:02.422 --> 04:03.342
It's exam week.

04:03.422 --> 04:04.222
The intensity's high

04:04.302 --> 04:05.582
and meals are not on time.

04:06.301 --> 04:07.541
When Zhu Yangqi comes back,

04:07.621 --> 04:08.902
let's ask him to work out.

04:09.301 --> 04:11.261
My back and waist kill me after class.

04:11.341 --> 04:12.542
I feel lousy all over.

04:13.462 --> 04:13.983
Alright.

04:14.063 --> 04:15.261
It saves on hiring a trainer.

04:15.902 --> 04:17.181
He seems to return next week.

04:17.341 --> 04:18.022
Scheduled.

04:18.301 --> 04:19.542
Still not on vacation?

04:19.821 --> 04:21.822
Beijing Theater Academy
has no broadcasting.

04:21.902 --> 04:22.742
If I got in,

04:22.822 --> 04:24.141
I'd be still staying at school

04:24.221 --> 04:25.542
like Zhu Yangqi.

04:28.301 --> 04:30.301
Why do you keep
talking about Zhu Yangqi?

04:31.502 --> 04:33.102
You're not falling for him, are you?

04:36.781 --> 04:37.781
Is it that obvious?

04:38.462 --> 04:39.382
Since when?

04:39.462 --> 04:40.181
Together now?

04:40.301 --> 04:41.301
Not yet.

04:41.542 --> 04:43.582
I must focus on
reviewing cultural courses.

04:44.422 --> 04:45.582
When I get into college,

04:46.181 --> 04:47.301
I'll tell him.

04:47.502 --> 04:48.821
I think it's okay.

04:49.102 --> 04:50.101
Those two in the room.

04:50.181 --> 04:51.181
Come out to eat!

04:52.542 --> 04:54.101
Don't tell my dad about Zhu Yangqi.

04:54.181 --> 04:55.541
Don't tell my dad about Luzhou.

04:55.621 --> 04:56.621
Okay.

04:59.261 --> 04:59.943
Come on.

05:00.023 --> 05:01.061
Good girl,

05:01.141 --> 05:02.542
eat a piece of fish

05:02.982 --> 05:03.982
to nourish your brain.

05:04.221 --> 05:04.862
- Thank you, Dad.
- Studying is tiring.

05:04.942 --> 05:05.502
Look.

05:05.582 --> 05:06.582
You've lost weight.

05:10.341 --> 05:12.301
Dad, drink some chicken soup
to nourish your body.

05:20.462 --> 05:21.462
Come on.

05:22.022 --> 05:23.542
Red beans and red dates

05:24.261 --> 05:25.261
are nourishment.

05:26.862 --> 05:27.862
Come on.

05:29.382 --> 05:29.702
For me?

05:29.782 --> 05:30.862
Drink it to look healthy.

05:30.942 --> 05:31.942
Thank you, Dad.

05:36.462 --> 05:37.781
Dad, let me get you some greens.

05:39.141 --> 05:39.741
Eat more.

05:39.902 --> 05:40.902
Okay.

05:41.382 --> 05:43.181
Try some of the greens.

05:45.862 --> 05:46.862
Yingying,

05:47.942 --> 05:48.902
serve a bowl of soup

05:48.982 --> 05:49.982
for me.

05:50.621 --> 05:51.621
Why not do it yourself?

05:51.701 --> 05:52.982
My hands are all greasy.

05:56.542 --> 05:57.541
Fine.

05:57.621 --> 05:58.862
I'll get the bowl myself.

06:00.221 --> 06:01.221
You're right.

06:01.621 --> 06:02.701
Mine is a bit drafty.

06:04.422 --> 06:05.102
How is it?

06:05.382 --> 06:06.181
Are those delicious?

06:06.261 --> 06:07.062
Very delicious.

06:07.181 --> 06:08.181
Then eat more.

06:08.661 --> 06:10.701
Our Xu family's unique recipe.

06:15.942 --> 06:16.422
Come on.

06:16.661 --> 06:17.902
My drafty cotton-padded jacket.

06:17.982 --> 06:19.302
I serve you a bowl of soup?

06:19.382 --> 06:20.181
Okay.

06:20.261 --> 06:21.261
Serve more.

06:24.502 --> 06:25.262
All the good stuff

06:25.342 --> 06:26.462
went into your bowl.

06:26.542 --> 06:27.621
I'll give you this bowl.

06:27.701 --> 06:29.462
No need.

06:31.301 --> 06:32.302
I don't want to go.

06:32.382 --> 06:34.022
I haven't finished saying to you.

06:34.102 --> 06:35.741
Then let's talk about it another day.

06:35.902 --> 06:37.101
Yingying, that's enough.

06:37.181 --> 06:38.462
- It's fine.
- Go. He is waiting for you.

06:38.942 --> 06:40.022
Then I'm leaving.

06:40.102 --> 06:40.621
Bye-bye.

06:40.701 --> 06:41.342
- Hurry up.
- Bye-bye.

06:41.422 --> 06:42.422
- Bye-bye.
- Let's go.

06:42.502 --> 06:43.462
Bye-bye, Mr. Cai.

06:43.542 --> 06:44.221
Bye-bye.

06:44.301 --> 06:44.982
Bye-bye!

06:45.062 --> 06:45.622
That's enough.

06:45.702 --> 06:47.062
It's not a farewell forever.

06:57.701 --> 06:59.102
Dad, let's watch some TV.

07:00.741 --> 07:01.741
Okay.

07:03.341 --> 07:04.302
Watch what?

07:04.382 --> 07:05.062
Watching the show

07:05.142 --> 07:06.181
you've been following?

07:06.982 --> 07:07.982
Anything is fine.

08:02.902 --> 08:04.022
So sleepy.

08:05.022 --> 08:07.621
L-Let's sleep.

08:15.382 --> 08:16.662
- Good night.
- Good night.

08:37.301 --> 08:38.301
Hello.

08:41.622 --> 08:43.581
I was just watching TV with my daughter.

08:45.221 --> 08:46.862
(Reporting today's situation.)

08:47.221 --> 08:47.823
(After dinner,)

08:47.903 --> 08:49.782
(I especially watched TV with my dad.)

08:50.022 --> 08:51.822
(His mood is very stable.)

08:55.181 --> 08:57.822
(Now your boyfriend's not so stable.)

08:58.622 --> 09:00.461
(No message in six hours.)

09:01.181 --> 09:03.022
(I thought you were in the bathroom)

09:03.102 --> 09:04.102
(and passed out.)

09:06.742 --> 09:08.982
(I'm afraid my dad sees me
replying too frequently.)

09:09.062 --> 09:10.062
(He might suspect.)

09:10.622 --> 09:12.341
(Can we video call later?)

09:13.662 --> 09:14.461
(No.)

09:14.622 --> 09:15.662
(You wish.)

09:19.501 --> 09:20.501
(I'm going to sleep.)

09:20.902 --> 09:21.902
(Good night.)

09:22.622 --> 09:24.582
(You better pray
for a snowstorm in Beijing)

09:24.662 --> 09:26.461
(can trap me.)

09:26.702 --> 09:28.702
(Or I'll fix you
when I return to Qingyi.)

09:35.421 --> 09:38.141
(Promise kept, Shy Boy Chen.)

09:41.221 --> 09:41.863
(I advise you)

09:41.943 --> 09:43.862
(not to provoke me
who you left in Beijing,)

09:43.942 --> 09:45.822
(feeling all neglected.)

09:47.341 --> 09:48.381
(I'm going to sleep,)

09:48.461 --> 09:49.501
(really tired.)

09:50.022 --> 09:51.582
(Today was a busy day.)

09:51.662 --> 09:52.782
(Really exhausted.)

10:05.822 --> 10:07.062
(Spend time with your dad.)

10:07.702 --> 10:09.261
(I have taken a backseat.)

10:09.782 --> 10:10.982
(Call me if you miss me.)

10:11.062 --> 10:12.102
(Any time is fine.)

10:24.894 --> 10:29.048
(Vacation, Day 1)

10:35.341 --> 10:36.381
Please come in.

10:39.381 --> 10:40.381
Awake?

10:40.782 --> 10:41.982
Good morning.

10:42.141 --> 10:43.702
Do you want to have breakfast?

10:45.782 --> 10:47.101
Haven't you had peanut porridge

10:47.181 --> 10:48.541
I made in a long time?

10:50.261 --> 10:51.261
Get up soon.

10:51.461 --> 10:52.461
It's ready.

10:52.902 --> 10:53.582
Okay.

10:53.662 --> 10:55.301
Alright, waiting for you.

11:00.581 --> 11:01.581
(Day 2)
Please come in.

11:04.301 --> 11:05.822
What do you want for lunch today?

11:07.102 --> 11:08.622
Water spinach,

11:08.702 --> 11:09.702
ribbonfish,

11:09.982 --> 11:11.062
lotus root and peanut soup.

11:11.301 --> 11:12.501
Just these three, right?

11:12.581 --> 11:14.381
And brown sugar glutinous rice cake.

11:14.662 --> 11:15.662
Wait.

11:18.181 --> 11:19.181
(Day 3)
Zhi!

11:19.461 --> 11:20.461
Eat.

11:22.501 --> 11:23.541
What to eat?

11:24.381 --> 11:27.902
Your favorite fried small river shrimps.

11:27.982 --> 11:29.102
The canteen doesn't have it.

11:33.902 --> 11:34.902
Let's start.

11:37.622 --> 11:39.301
Smells good.

11:40.222 --> 11:42.742
(Day 4)

11:42.822 --> 11:44.022
Dad, you haven't cooked yet.

11:44.102 --> 11:45.102
Where are you going?

11:45.341 --> 11:46.341
Today I don't have time.

11:47.501 --> 11:48.542
Order takeout yourself.

11:48.622 --> 11:50.501
I-I have to work overtime
at the hospital.

11:55.581 --> 11:56.581
(Day 5)
I go for a run.

11:57.421 --> 11:58.023
After that,

11:58.103 --> 12:00.102
bring me
a serving of Fengxiang xiaolongbao.

12:06.110 --> 12:09.016
(Day 6)

12:10.622 --> 12:11.622
Dad.

12:12.261 --> 12:13.461
What for dinner?

12:14.662 --> 12:15.662
Don't rush me.

12:15.902 --> 12:17.662
Skipping a meal won't starve you.

12:18.141 --> 12:19.141
Wait a moment.

12:24.461 --> 12:25.141
(Day N)
Dad,

12:25.301 --> 12:25.782
I...

12:25.982 --> 12:27.301
When will you go back to school?

12:35.022 --> 12:36.541
Booking tickets early is much cheaper.

12:43.581 --> 12:44.742
- Come on. Have a drink.
- Come on.

12:44.822 --> 12:45.782
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

12:45.862 --> 12:47.181
- Long time no see!
- Long time no see!

12:51.862 --> 12:52.742
Just downed it in one?

12:52.862 --> 12:53.422
Of course.

12:53.502 --> 12:54.662
How are things lately?

12:54.862 --> 12:55.582
- Absolutely!
- Fine.

12:55.662 --> 12:56.582
- Pretty good.
- It's fine.

12:56.662 --> 12:57.462
You're pretty good?

12:57.542 --> 12:58.742
I'm okay for now.

12:59.261 --> 13:00.782
Just a bit too tired lately.

13:03.702 --> 13:04.421
- Don't mind me.
- Try that dish.

13:04.501 --> 13:05.501
- Go ahead.
- Not bad.

13:06.261 --> 13:07.421
- Eat this.
- Try this.

13:07.501 --> 13:08.501
Hello, Zhi.

13:09.141 --> 13:10.101
My boyfriend in Beijing,

13:10.181 --> 13:11.581
you're not done yet?

13:13.062 --> 13:13.942
I'm eating out.

13:14.022 --> 13:15.022
I just didn't see it.

13:17.942 --> 13:19.101
I'm eating this late.

13:19.181 --> 13:20.181
Aren't you asking why?

13:21.022 --> 13:22.782
If you don't love me anymore,
don't force it.

13:22.942 --> 13:24.822
Stop teasing. I'm serious.

13:25.022 --> 13:26.421
Xu has been acting weird lately.

13:26.501 --> 13:27.142
Do you remember?

13:27.222 --> 13:29.022
When I just got back,

13:29.181 --> 13:31.421
he made me a new dish every single day.

13:31.782 --> 13:32.663
But now,

13:32.743 --> 13:34.301
I asked him what he was making.

13:34.381 --> 13:36.022
He said skipping a meal won't starve me.

13:36.902 --> 13:37.663
Today is weirder.

13:37.743 --> 13:39.421
He asked me when I'll return to Beijing.

13:41.301 --> 13:42.301
Don't overthink it.

13:42.421 --> 13:43.501
Aren't parents like this?

13:44.501 --> 13:45.662
Distance creates beauty.

13:46.461 --> 13:48.141
Parents miss kids
when they're not around.

13:48.221 --> 13:49.982
But get frustrated
when they're always there.

13:51.341 --> 13:52.341
But now every day he

13:52.421 --> 13:54.221
comes back later and later.

13:54.381 --> 13:55.902
Once he returns, he heads to bedroom.

13:56.421 --> 13:58.381
Zhi, you know what you're acting like now?

13:58.702 --> 13:59.982
Like a bad guy hurts you.

14:00.062 --> 14:01.982
You come find a backup for comfort.

14:03.501 --> 14:05.381
No, Xu is really acting strange.

14:05.702 --> 14:06.942
He got a call last night,

14:07.102 --> 14:08.541
saying it was an emergency and left.

14:08.782 --> 14:10.381
What kind of emergency in andrology?

14:10.541 --> 14:12.221
There should be some, right?

14:13.022 --> 14:16.102
Young, single guys

14:16.742 --> 14:17.862
with a lot of curiosity.

14:18.261 --> 14:19.622
They get themselves into trouble.

14:21.261 --> 14:22.261
For example?

14:23.862 --> 14:24.822
For example...

14:24.902 --> 14:26.862
Why don't we order something else?

14:26.942 --> 14:28.542
Someone just arrived said

14:28.622 --> 14:29.341
BBQ is delicious.

14:29.421 --> 14:30.342
- Not bad.
- Sounds good.

14:30.422 --> 14:31.822
I haven't had seafood for long.

14:31.902 --> 14:33.782
- Waiter.
- I really miss the crabs from Qingyi.

14:33.862 --> 14:34.862
How many are attending?

14:34.942 --> 14:35.942
Who's all there?

14:36.301 --> 14:37.702
Ke, Zhang Yu,

14:37.862 --> 14:39.221
and a few classmates.

14:39.421 --> 14:41.022
See what else to add.

14:41.381 --> 14:41.902
Ke,

14:42.181 --> 14:42.863
don't order mine.

14:42.943 --> 14:44.022
I'll be going back soon.

14:44.421 --> 14:46.261
Wang Yue awaits me to revise the thesis.

14:46.902 --> 14:48.221
You just came and you're leaving?

14:48.301 --> 14:49.222
Yeah.

14:49.302 --> 14:50.822
- It's rare for us to gather.
- Right.

14:50.822 --> 14:52.141
Why are you revising thesis?

14:52.221 --> 14:52.863
Do it tomorrow.

14:52.863 --> 14:54.301
- Exactly.
- Ke will be with you.

14:54.301 --> 14:55.261
I'll accompany you.

14:55.341 --> 14:56.062
Zhang Yu,

14:56.221 --> 14:57.982
he is leaving. Won't you stop him?

14:59.221 --> 15:00.102
Chen Luzhou

15:00.182 --> 15:02.341
is quite busy now
with the math modeling competition.

15:02.421 --> 15:04.261
So don't hold him back, right?

15:04.501 --> 15:05.261
Wait. You...

15:05.461 --> 15:07.702
Don't imply anything
between Zhang Yu and me.

15:07.902 --> 15:09.622
My girlfriend is still on the call here.

15:09.702 --> 15:10.902
How do I explain this?

15:12.622 --> 15:14.141
Honey is checking up on you.

15:16.501 --> 15:17.702
Female desk mates?

15:17.822 --> 15:19.022
What if I get jealous?

15:19.141 --> 15:20.141
Stop it.

15:20.301 --> 15:21.142
Student gathering.

15:21.222 --> 15:22.261
Why would you be jealous?

15:24.461 --> 15:26.022
Chen Luzhou, I'm jealous.

15:26.782 --> 15:28.061
I originally wanted to tell you

15:28.141 --> 15:30.102
I want to take back what I said earlier.

15:30.662 --> 15:32.622
Because I really miss you in Qingyi.

15:32.782 --> 15:34.662
But now I don't want to take it back.

15:36.261 --> 15:37.301
Because I'm angry.

15:37.541 --> 15:38.221
That's it.

15:38.381 --> 15:39.381
Bye-bye.

15:42.742 --> 15:43.822
I'll stay with you, okay?

15:45.501 --> 15:46.501
I'm leaving.

15:47.221 --> 15:48.221
Leaving now?

15:48.301 --> 15:49.301
I'm going back.

15:49.421 --> 15:50.421
- Take your time eating.
- Bye-bye.

15:51.221 --> 15:52.101
- Okay.
- See you.

15:52.181 --> 15:52.703
Okay.

15:52.783 --> 15:54.421
- Bye-bye.
- Bye-bye.

15:57.461 --> 15:58.461
Please come in.

16:00.461 --> 16:01.542
There's an emergency.

16:01.622 --> 16:02.222
I have to go.

16:02.302 --> 16:03.622
You're going out again, huh?

16:03.942 --> 16:04.942
I kept a bowl of wontons.

16:05.062 --> 16:05.662
Have it.

16:05.742 --> 16:06.742
Or it will be soggy.

16:30.261 --> 16:30.782
Director,

16:30.982 --> 16:32.301
my son is still lying here.

16:32.381 --> 16:33.381
Why not take care of him?

16:33.461 --> 16:34.903
Sir, he just has external injuries.

16:34.983 --> 16:36.181
We've already treated him.

16:36.261 --> 16:37.942
There are several
more serious cases now.

16:38.022 --> 16:41.023
Ms. Wei's son is also in there.
He was hurt bad but gave up his bed.

16:41.103 --> 16:42.902
What does her son have to do with me?

16:42.982 --> 16:44.622
- My son is still lying here.
- Alright.

16:44.702 --> 16:45.301
No fighting.

16:45.381 --> 16:46.141
Enough.

16:46.301 --> 16:48.782
We'll take your son to radiology

16:48.902 --> 16:49.742
for a quick X-ray.

16:49.902 --> 16:50.663
Rest assured.

16:50.743 --> 16:51.702
Arrange it now, okay?

16:51.782 --> 16:51.982
Okay.

16:52.062 --> 16:52.823
Don't worry.

16:52.903 --> 16:53.862
No problem.

16:53.942 --> 16:54.502
- Go.
- Thank you.

16:54.582 --> 16:55.622
Come on.

16:56.181 --> 16:57.061
What's going on here?

16:57.141 --> 16:57.862
So many people.

16:57.942 --> 16:58.501
Perfect time.

16:58.622 --> 16:59.301
Listen.

16:59.501 --> 17:00.501
Be mentally prepared.

17:01.141 --> 17:01.943
Ms. Wei's son

17:02.023 --> 17:03.181
just sent to emergency room.

17:03.581 --> 17:04.581
It's that serious?

17:04.742 --> 17:06.582
There was a fire
in boys' dormitory building.

17:06.662 --> 17:07.662
Take a look.

17:08.062 --> 17:10.101
Burns shouldn't be sent to our hospital.

17:10.181 --> 17:10.942
Not burns.

17:11.181 --> 17:12.381
He acted bravely.

17:12.541 --> 17:13.982
He ran to save his classmates

17:14.062 --> 17:15.622
and got hit by a load-bearing pillar.

17:16.622 --> 17:17.622
Hit there?

17:18.622 --> 17:19.782
Don't make everything about

17:19.982 --> 17:20.862
your department,

17:20.942 --> 17:21.422
okay?

17:21.502 --> 17:22.582
I work for it.

17:22.662 --> 17:23.702
Then what I should do?

17:24.702 --> 17:25.862
He thought his mom

17:25.942 --> 17:27.061
worked here as a doctor.

17:27.141 --> 17:27.863
He came here

17:27.943 --> 17:29.742
and used up the hospital's resources.

17:29.822 --> 17:30.422
You know?

17:30.502 --> 17:31.542
He wanted to give his bed

17:31.622 --> 17:32.902
to one of his classmates.

17:32.982 --> 17:33.623
He's arguing

17:33.703 --> 17:35.221
about this matter with his mom.

17:35.341 --> 17:36.341
I asked you to come here

17:36.541 --> 17:37.581
to persuade them.

17:39.062 --> 17:40.662
If I hadn't seen so many people,

17:40.742 --> 17:42.461
I would think you were talking nonsense.

17:42.822 --> 17:43.381
I...

17:43.742 --> 17:45.221
I'm doing this for your good. You...

17:47.381 --> 17:49.501
Everything else is fine, right?

17:49.581 --> 17:50.581
It only hurts here?

17:50.742 --> 17:51.822
It really hurts right here.

17:52.062 --> 17:53.221
It might be a bone fracture.

17:53.301 --> 17:54.301
You must have a check-up.

17:55.102 --> 17:56.101
Look at you.

17:56.181 --> 17:58.421
Didn't your school
have fire drills before?

17:58.501 --> 18:00.101
You were outside perfectly fine,

18:00.181 --> 18:01.341
but you ran into the fire.

18:01.421 --> 18:02.421
What were you thinking?

18:02.902 --> 18:04.782
There are firefighters
for saving people.

18:05.102 --> 18:06.782
Did you really need
to play the hero here?

18:09.461 --> 18:10.501
How is Lin doing?

18:10.862 --> 18:12.301
Dr. Xu, you came too.

18:13.301 --> 18:15.141
Mr. Cai told me
there was a major accident.

18:15.381 --> 18:16.702
To avoid being short-handed,

18:16.942 --> 18:18.022
he asked me to come.

18:18.581 --> 18:19.382
We just said

18:19.462 --> 18:21.421
this time it's actually quite dangerous.

18:21.501 --> 18:22.501
Lin,

18:22.862 --> 18:23.902
you are very brave.

18:31.541 --> 18:33.782
Hello, may I ask
where Dr. Xu Guangji is?

18:34.822 --> 18:37.102
He just seemed to go over
to the emergency ward.

18:37.581 --> 18:38.581
Thank you.

18:47.581 --> 18:49.022
He just knows how to play the hero.

18:50.221 --> 18:51.622
What heroics did I perform?

18:51.702 --> 18:53.022
My roommate is sleeping inside.

18:53.102 --> 18:54.261
I can't watch them

18:54.341 --> 18:55.142
be burned to death.

18:55.222 --> 18:56.261
Exactly.

18:57.062 --> 18:57.662
Exactly.

18:57.862 --> 18:58.782
So you are here.

18:58.862 --> 18:59.743
It's fine.

18:59.823 --> 19:00.902
No need to worry.

19:01.541 --> 19:02.342
Dr. Xu,

19:02.422 --> 19:03.702
I didn't mess up, right?

19:03.782 --> 19:04.782
A real man.

19:04.862 --> 19:05.581
This point,

19:05.862 --> 19:06.862
I support you.

19:07.102 --> 19:08.102
Take it easy.

19:08.662 --> 19:09.542
The leg is injury?

19:09.622 --> 19:10.622
I forgot.

19:10.742 --> 19:11.382
Forget it.

19:11.462 --> 19:13.261
- Let's talk outside.
- Okay.

19:13.461 --> 19:15.942
Mom, say whatever
you have to say to my face.

19:16.062 --> 19:18.102
I know you are dating.

19:20.341 --> 19:21.662
Nonsense.

19:21.862 --> 19:23.381
I already know. Don't pretend with me.

19:24.141 --> 19:25.381
Just date.

19:25.742 --> 19:26.862
I'm not going to oppose.

19:28.301 --> 19:29.341
Lin,

19:30.062 --> 19:31.341
take good care of your injury.

19:31.581 --> 19:32.862
After you are discharged,

19:32.982 --> 19:34.862
I will prepare a big gift for you

19:35.141 --> 19:37.461
to commend your bravery this time.

19:40.461 --> 19:41.702
When you are discharged,

19:42.022 --> 19:44.421
I'll give you a big gift.

19:44.742 --> 19:46.542
Rewarding you for being so young

19:46.622 --> 19:49.102
and staying in such a swanky room.

19:49.341 --> 19:50.341
Okay?

20:01.341 --> 20:02.461
Thank you, Dad.

20:02.662 --> 20:03.622
You...

20:03.702 --> 20:04.302
You brat.

20:04.382 --> 20:05.461
Don't mess about. Lie down.

20:05.541 --> 20:07.022
Anyway, it's just a matter of time.

20:07.261 --> 20:08.261
Slow down.

20:16.541 --> 20:17.261
Is that

20:17.461 --> 20:19.062
your daughter?

20:24.102 --> 20:25.102
Zhi.

20:26.301 --> 20:27.301
Why are you here?

20:30.421 --> 20:32.022
You left your phone at home.

20:32.141 --> 20:33.942
I brought it over in case you needed it.

20:34.062 --> 20:35.062
Hello.

20:35.742 --> 20:37.181
T-This is Ms. Wei.

20:37.742 --> 20:38.862
Hello, Xu Zhi.

20:42.421 --> 20:43.381
Dad,

20:43.461 --> 20:44.461
actually,

20:44.942 --> 20:46.381
you could have just told me earlier.

20:46.622 --> 20:47.622
It's okay.

20:47.862 --> 20:49.541
Actually, I

20:50.181 --> 20:52.301
was planning to tell you after a while.

20:52.942 --> 20:54.461
It's okay. I'll head back.

20:54.742 --> 20:55.421
Ms. Wei,

20:55.581 --> 20:56.902
come over for a bite.

20:56.982 --> 20:58.022
Let's meet up.

20:59.062 --> 21:00.581
Okay, thank you.

21:01.102 --> 21:01.742
I'm leaving.

21:01.902 --> 21:02.902
By the way.

21:05.022 --> 21:06.022
On your way back,

21:06.822 --> 21:07.622
be careful.

21:07.742 --> 21:08.742
Okay.

21:08.982 --> 21:10.581
- Bye-bye.
- Bye-bye.

21:25.484 --> 21:30.793
(Tickets Information)

21:35.501 --> 21:37.942
I've prepared all the attachments
and proof materials.

21:38.341 --> 21:38.943
Luzhou,

21:39.023 --> 21:40.461
just attach them at the back.

21:45.022 --> 21:46.022
Luzhou.

21:51.261 --> 21:52.261
Hey.

21:52.782 --> 21:53.782
What's wrong?

21:55.862 --> 21:56.982
Zhi didn't answer the phone.

22:01.141 --> 22:01.742
Don't worry.

22:01.982 --> 22:02.742
She was jealous.

22:02.822 --> 22:03.381
Yeah.

22:03.461 --> 22:04.461
She might be mad at you.

22:04.742 --> 22:06.421
My girlfriend does this often.
It's okay.

22:06.662 --> 22:07.982
Right, her phone may

22:08.062 --> 22:09.301
not be charged.

22:09.461 --> 22:09.783
Normal.

22:09.863 --> 22:10.902
Yeah. That's possible.

22:16.782 --> 22:17.782
I'm listening.

22:17.942 --> 22:19.622
She didn't answer. No one at home.

22:19.822 --> 22:20.822
But don't worry.

22:20.942 --> 22:22.022
I'll go nearby to search.

22:23.862 --> 22:24.663
Alright then,

22:24.743 --> 22:26.102
give me a call if you have news.

22:26.662 --> 22:27.662
Okay.

22:35.942 --> 22:37.022
I'll return Qingyi.

22:37.822 --> 22:38.583
Don't worry.

22:38.663 --> 22:40.181
I return before the competition, okay?

22:40.782 --> 22:41.782
It's okay.

22:42.742 --> 22:44.341
- Sorry.
- Stay safe.

23:14.622 --> 23:15.582
Xu Zhi.

23:15.662 --> 23:16.662
Xu Zhi!

23:16.902 --> 23:18.022
You finally showed up.

23:18.102 --> 23:18.983
Where did you go?

23:19.063 --> 23:20.261
Why not answer the phone?

23:21.261 --> 23:22.341
I didn't bring my phone.

23:23.261 --> 23:24.421
It is charging.

23:24.902 --> 23:26.982
Chen Luzhou has been going crazy
looking for you?

23:27.141 --> 23:28.421
He has booked the air ticket.

23:28.501 --> 23:29.702
Hurry up and call him back.

23:30.702 --> 23:31.702
Really?

23:54.421 --> 23:55.381
Hello,

23:55.461 --> 23:56.461
where are you?

23:56.662 --> 23:57.982
I'm on the way to the airport.

23:58.461 --> 23:59.382
Competition will start.

23:59.462 --> 24:00.782
What's gotten into you?

24:01.461 --> 24:02.461
I should be asking you.

24:02.942 --> 24:04.062
Why not answer my call?

24:09.782 --> 24:10.822
You beat me.

24:12.181 --> 24:13.541
What time is your flight?

24:14.141 --> 24:15.141
1:30 AM.

24:16.022 --> 24:16.702
I'm fine.

24:16.782 --> 24:17.782
Go back quickly.

24:18.102 --> 24:19.982
If the weather is bad,
you won't make it back.

24:20.181 --> 24:22.141
Your effort this half semester
will be wasted.

24:29.381 --> 24:30.381
Chen Luzhou,

24:31.822 --> 24:33.742
are you worried that
I'll break up with you?

24:37.862 --> 24:39.341
I-I don't know what to say.

24:41.261 --> 24:42.822
Maybe I haven't seen you for long.

24:43.581 --> 24:44.702
During this time,

24:44.982 --> 24:45.942
I've been really busy.

24:46.022 --> 24:47.541
We haven't had a good chat.

24:48.581 --> 24:49.662
I'm just worried you...

24:57.221 --> 24:57.982
Cai Yingying said

24:58.062 --> 24:58.983
she couldn't reach you.

24:59.063 --> 25:00.381
I feared you were in trouble.

25:01.822 --> 25:03.102
I went to the hospital.

25:04.381 --> 25:05.942
I hurried and forgot my phone.

25:06.062 --> 25:07.062
Why went to the hospital?

25:07.301 --> 25:08.301
Are you feeling unwell?

25:08.541 --> 25:09.261
No.

25:09.461 --> 25:10.221
It's my dad.

25:10.341 --> 25:11.421
He took an emergency case

25:11.501 --> 25:12.542
and went to the hospital,

25:12.622 --> 25:13.462
without his phone.

25:13.542 --> 25:14.622
So I brought it to him.

25:16.381 --> 25:18.381
I happened to meet his girlfriend.

25:18.782 --> 25:19.782
It took a while.

25:20.581 --> 25:21.581
Girlfriend?

25:22.301 --> 25:23.782
When did he have a girlfriend?

25:25.102 --> 25:26.982
She's the chief at my dad's hospital.

25:34.501 --> 25:35.501
Chen Luzhou,

25:37.982 --> 25:39.301
now I only have you.

25:41.221 --> 25:42.822
As long as you don't break up with me,

25:43.102 --> 25:44.381
we won't break up.

25:46.261 --> 25:47.261
Wait for me at home.

25:47.902 --> 25:48.902
I'll be back soon.

25:49.822 --> 25:50.542
I'm fine.

25:50.622 --> 25:51.622
I'm quite good.

25:52.301 --> 25:53.581
I'm happy for my dad.

25:54.581 --> 25:55.581
I understand.

26:00.662 --> 26:01.662
Shy Boy Chen,

26:02.141 --> 26:03.341
I'm a bit angry right now.

26:03.461 --> 26:04.702
Because you were harsh to me.

26:06.461 --> 26:07.902
I was really in a hurry just now.

26:08.942 --> 26:09.942
How about this?

26:10.062 --> 26:11.221
When I go come back, you...

26:11.662 --> 26:12.662
You beat me up.

26:13.662 --> 26:14.502
Do whatever you want.

26:14.582 --> 26:16.662
If I dare to make a sound,
you can discard me.

26:17.102 --> 26:18.102
Is that okay?

26:20.181 --> 26:21.301
That's more like it.

26:22.141 --> 26:23.662
Alright, it's too late now.

26:23.742 --> 26:24.742
Go back quickly.

26:24.822 --> 26:26.461
Wang Yue and Li Ke are waiting for you.

26:28.341 --> 26:29.341
Alright.

26:32.254 --> 26:36.872
♪The streetlights gradually awaken♪

26:38.430 --> 26:40.764
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

26:40.990 --> 26:43.523
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

26:43.678 --> 26:46.223
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

26:46.223 --> 26:48.902
♪The whole world pauses♪

26:48.982 --> 26:50.221
(Building 7, Room 903.)

26:50.662 --> 26:51.742
(I just rented it.)

26:52.421 --> 26:53.822
(Two buildings away from you.)

26:54.461 --> 26:56.742
(Our College Entrance Examination
scores are door codes.)

26:57.782 --> 26:58.942
(I haven't arranged it yet.)

26:59.022 --> 27:00.782
(You can arrange it as you like.)

27:01.782 --> 27:03.381
(With a new madam with you,)

27:03.782 --> 27:04.543
(if you want,)

27:04.623 --> 27:05.702
(you can come to my place.)

27:06.862 --> 27:08.381
(My home only has a place for you.)

27:09.141 --> 27:10.141
(No one else.)

27:12.894 --> 27:15.684
♪Ah, ah, ah♪

27:15.782 --> 27:16.782
(Chen Luzhou,)

27:17.622 --> 27:18.702
(it's nice to have you.)

27:45.301 --> 27:47.341
Come on. This bottle of wine is amazing.

27:47.662 --> 27:48.662
I got this Nverhong

27:48.742 --> 27:49.662
when she was born.

27:49.742 --> 27:50.501
Today, let's

27:50.581 --> 27:51.581
will finish it off.

27:51.702 --> 27:52.782
Today?

27:53.062 --> 27:53.583
Dad, you say

27:53.663 --> 27:55.141
you'll drink it at my wedding?

27:55.541 --> 27:56.422
Your wedding

27:56.502 --> 27:57.862
will be ages away.

27:58.501 --> 27:59.221
I've decided.

27:59.341 --> 28:00.782
I'll be nicer to the two of us.

28:00.942 --> 28:01.261
Open!

28:01.541 --> 28:02.662
- What do you mean?
- Okay.

28:02.742 --> 28:04.022
I'll bring a boy back tomorrow.

28:04.102 --> 28:04.742
Do you believe?

28:05.022 --> 28:05.623
Okay.

28:05.703 --> 28:07.581
But it can't be that "pig".

28:07.782 --> 28:09.101
Don't call him "pig".

28:09.181 --> 28:09.783
You're a "pig".

28:09.863 --> 28:11.301
I don't care what he is.

28:11.381 --> 28:12.381
Anyway, it's not okay.

28:14.141 --> 28:15.141
Then let's just drink.

28:15.261 --> 28:16.261
Let's do it!

28:19.301 --> 28:20.261
When pouring the wine,

28:20.341 --> 28:20.982
indeed,

28:21.062 --> 28:21.943
I feel emotional.

28:22.023 --> 28:23.301
You see, this year,

28:23.702 --> 28:24.702
we're all here.

28:25.022 --> 28:26.421
Why this Spring Festival

28:26.501 --> 28:27.702
passed a bit

28:28.221 --> 28:29.782
different from previous years.

28:31.421 --> 28:32.582
Actually, it's because they

28:32.662 --> 28:34.221
have gradually all started school.

28:34.461 --> 28:36.341
Yingying will start school
next year, right?

28:36.982 --> 28:37.942
It'll be half a year

28:38.022 --> 28:39.022
before she can come home.

28:39.102 --> 28:39.743
So,

28:39.823 --> 28:41.301
this year's reunion dinner

28:41.662 --> 28:42.662
is meaningful.

28:43.022 --> 28:44.022
It's okay.

28:44.261 --> 28:45.381
As long as it's for studies,

28:45.541 --> 28:46.742
I can meet her

28:46.822 --> 28:47.822
once a year.

28:47.942 --> 28:48.942
But it's no problem.

28:49.181 --> 28:50.541
Don't have much pressure.

28:50.662 --> 28:52.221
Forget those

28:52.301 --> 28:53.421
top universities.

28:53.742 --> 28:55.061
I don't have high expectations.

28:55.141 --> 28:56.742
Just get into a first-tier university.

28:56.822 --> 28:57.262
You sure?

28:57.342 --> 28:58.622
(Did the competition end?)

28:58.702 --> 28:59.462
First-tier!

28:59.542 --> 29:01.942
You're treating it like a trip
to the grocery store.

29:02.221 --> 29:03.142
But fortunately,

29:03.222 --> 29:04.822
I have potential.

29:05.261 --> 29:06.381
And I'll get in

29:06.461 --> 29:07.622
and become

29:07.702 --> 29:08.862
a great host later.

29:09.022 --> 29:10.022
Right, Zhi?

29:10.301 --> 29:10.782
Alright.

29:10.862 --> 29:11.862
Yes.

29:12.022 --> 29:13.501
You've been "tearing down the walls"

29:13.581 --> 29:15.181
for our family's arts and culture cause.

29:16.102 --> 29:17.181
I knew you'd be unkind.

29:17.261 --> 29:18.582
May your wishes come true.

29:18.662 --> 29:19.543
Happy New Year!

29:19.623 --> 29:20.742
- Come on.
- Happy New Year!

29:38.062 --> 29:39.862
I'm going to deliver some food.

29:40.181 --> 29:41.141
Are you going out?

29:41.221 --> 29:42.582
Wear more clothes.

29:42.662 --> 29:43.662
Okay.

29:45.221 --> 29:46.421
Terrible tolerance.

29:49.301 --> 29:50.341
Will your dad

29:50.421 --> 29:51.902
choke himself with all that snoring?

29:52.341 --> 29:53.822
I've never heard such loud snoring.

29:54.022 --> 29:55.341
Better than your dad's drill.

29:55.421 --> 29:56.822
It's your dad.

30:01.062 --> 30:04.221
(This year's Spring Festival
saw a heavy snowstorm in Beijing.)

30:04.541 --> 30:06.381
(Many workers couldn't reunite)

30:06.461 --> 30:07.862
(with their family)

30:08.062 --> 30:10.141
(for the construction
of the motherland.)

30:10.902 --> 30:11.982
(The next program)

30:12.062 --> 30:14.461
(will be performed by a special team.)

30:14.902 --> 30:17.141
(They will express
their respect and longing)

30:17.221 --> 30:19.542
(for these great workers)

30:19.622 --> 30:20.662
(through songs and dance.)

30:21.461 --> 30:23.582
(On this day of family reunion,)

30:23.662 --> 30:24.742
(let us together)

30:24.822 --> 30:25.663
(to those...)

30:25.743 --> 30:27.181
There are fireworks, Zhi.

30:27.341 --> 30:27.983
So beautiful.

30:28.063 --> 30:29.102
So nice.

30:29.982 --> 30:30.743
(Next up,)

30:30.823 --> 30:32.221
(please enjoy Hope of Spring,)

30:32.301 --> 30:34.301
(a dance brought by)

30:34.581 --> 30:35.341
(the special team.)

30:35.421 --> 30:35.823
Yes.

30:35.903 --> 30:36.982
Let's set off fireworks.

30:37.062 --> 30:38.181
But it's banned.

30:38.622 --> 30:39.662
Not the big ones.

30:39.742 --> 30:40.702
Just the sparklers

30:40.782 --> 30:41.782
on a stick.

30:42.062 --> 30:43.062
Very beautiful.

30:43.822 --> 30:44.822
Go.

30:44.942 --> 30:45.942
Let's go.

30:47.221 --> 30:49.662
(It can also let those working outside)

30:49.742 --> 30:53.301
(feel the care and blessings from home.)

30:53.381 --> 30:54.381
Go.

31:00.181 --> 31:01.301
Why don't you wear my shoes?

31:01.381 --> 31:02.101
Yours are thin.

31:02.181 --> 31:03.181
It's okay.

31:06.702 --> 31:07.341
Yingying,

31:07.702 --> 31:09.102
where to buy fireworks?

31:11.942 --> 31:13.301
I brought her here.

31:13.381 --> 31:14.381
Two meals.

31:15.301 --> 31:16.982
It is worth ten meals.

31:17.534 --> 31:24.321
♪Like a breeze drifting through the sky♪

31:24.862 --> 31:29.942
♪It wipes away
the trails of sorrow's sigh♪

31:30.022 --> 31:31.181
You must miss him crazy.

31:31.261 --> 31:32.501
I brought him to you.

31:33.341 --> 31:35.221
Weren't you not going to betray me?

31:35.341 --> 31:37.062
Wasn't it to give you a surprise?

31:37.742 --> 31:39.061
Come on. Let's go play

31:39.141 --> 31:40.408
- Go.
- I want to play this too.

31:41.662 --> 31:42.622
What are you doing?

31:42.702 --> 31:43.702
Please don't.

31:45.541 --> 31:46.541
I'm sorry.

31:47.062 --> 31:48.062
I come back late.

31:48.581 --> 31:49.581
You lied to me.

31:51.166 --> 31:54.477
♪Let every chapter of the story♪

31:55.262 --> 31:58.556
♪Align♪

32:00.638 --> 32:04.053
♪Even if it rains on you♪

32:04.622 --> 32:05.622
Happy New Year,

32:05.742 --> 32:06.742
Xu Zhi.

32:07.141 --> 32:07.982
Happy New Year,

32:08.062 --> 32:09.062
Chen Luzhou.

32:11.864 --> 32:14.416
♪Our love will last♪

32:14.622 --> 32:17.986
♪Even if it rains on you♪

32:18.462 --> 32:21.989
♪I will always be with you♪

32:22.421 --> 32:23.822
Are you done being lovey-dovey?

32:23.902 --> 32:25.221
We spent a whole day on a train.

32:25.301 --> 32:26.301
We haven't eaten.

32:26.742 --> 32:28.261
You took the train?

32:28.581 --> 32:29.581
Owing to the snow,

32:29.782 --> 32:31.341
flights and HSR are canceled.

32:32.862 --> 32:34.102
Do you want to eat something?

32:34.501 --> 32:35.501
Together?

32:35.902 --> 32:36.301
I...

32:36.862 --> 32:37.862
Let's go.

32:38.141 --> 32:39.862
- Go.
- The restaurants are about to close.

32:40.181 --> 32:41.581
Can you stop rushing?

32:42.381 --> 32:43.341
Dr. Xu.

32:43.421 --> 32:44.421
Mr. Xu.

32:44.541 --> 32:45.742
During the New Year holiday,

32:46.181 --> 32:47.221
why aren't you going home?

32:51.501 --> 32:52.742
What are you doing?

32:55.301 --> 32:56.542
I came to give Xu Zhi

32:56.622 --> 32:57.622
something.

33:00.301 --> 33:01.301
What?

33:02.662 --> 33:03.341
What?

33:03.541 --> 33:04.541
Books.

33:05.461 --> 33:06.662
Borrowed in summer vacation.

33:11.261 --> 33:13.062
This box is full of books?

33:13.622 --> 33:14.102
Yes.

33:14.381 --> 33:15.381
A box of books.

33:16.221 --> 33:17.341
That must be heavy.

33:18.341 --> 33:19.341
She can't lift it.

33:19.581 --> 33:19.942
Come on.

33:20.062 --> 33:21.062
I'll take it.

33:26.421 --> 33:27.902
Loving to learn is a good thing.

33:27.982 --> 33:28.581
Come on.

33:28.902 --> 33:29.421
Alright.

33:29.501 --> 33:30.501
Troublesome for you.

33:31.581 --> 33:32.581
Why stand there stunned?

33:33.581 --> 33:34.622
Go home and read.

33:37.381 --> 33:38.662
Then I'm leaving.

33:39.181 --> 33:40.381
The things in my box...

33:43.261 --> 33:44.662
Stop messing around.

33:53.902 --> 33:56.261
Is he at the same school as you now?

33:57.581 --> 33:58.582
Once he got to Beijing,

33:58.662 --> 34:00.141
he was then enrolled in our school.

34:02.461 --> 34:03.541
Alright, sleep early.

34:03.662 --> 34:05.381
Go visit your grandma tomorrow.

34:05.381 --> 34:06.822
Why not the third day of lunar year?

34:07.062 --> 34:08.221
I'm on duty that day.

34:08.421 --> 34:10.301
Stay a few more days with her.

34:11.102 --> 34:12.421
Then this box...

34:13.702 --> 34:15.822
Pack the books and send it to him.

34:17.982 --> 34:18.982
He needs it urgently?

34:19.181 --> 34:20.181
No.

34:22.102 --> 34:23.102
It's good.

34:30.942 --> 34:31.982
You bad boy.

34:32.261 --> 34:34.782
To pick you up I barely ate
New Year's Eve dinner.

34:34.942 --> 34:35.862
Have you no shame?

34:35.942 --> 34:36.823
Half an hour ago,

34:36.903 --> 34:38.542
you sent me a picture of
a big pork hoof?

34:38.622 --> 34:39.662
Are you a hungry ghost?

34:41.022 --> 34:42.102
Wheel cakes.

34:42.301 --> 34:43.782
Freshly made. Tasty and affordable.

34:44.622 --> 34:45.141
Boss,

34:45.381 --> 34:45.943
get me

34:46.023 --> 34:47.181
five

34:47.702 --> 34:48.421
taro ones,

34:48.541 --> 34:49.381
five matcha ones,

34:49.461 --> 34:50.942
and three meat floss ones.

34:51.022 --> 34:52.862
- Okay.
- Are you a pig, eating so much?

34:53.261 --> 34:54.501
That's the way it is, alright?

34:54.702 --> 34:55.862
You're a cabbage. I'm a pig.

34:55.942 --> 34:56.942
Isn't it fine?

34:57.261 --> 34:57.982
What?

34:58.062 --> 34:58.943
Others will only say

34:59.023 --> 35:00.702
a good cabbage got chewed by a pig.

35:01.902 --> 35:02.982
Sir, two red bean ones.

35:02.982 --> 35:03.542
Sure.

35:05.022 --> 35:06.822
Didn't you never
eat red bean paste before?

35:07.022 --> 35:08.022
Xu Zhi loves to eat it.

35:09.782 --> 35:10.902
- I shouldn't ask.
- Sir,

35:11.541 --> 35:12.622
do you have red bean ones?

35:13.862 --> 35:14.862
Gu Yan!

35:15.141 --> 35:16.702
You also came back for the New Year?

35:17.541 --> 35:19.381
Your recent web series is quite popular.

35:19.702 --> 35:21.662
I thought you'd
be busy promoting it everywhere.

35:22.141 --> 35:23.221
I'm just a supporting role.

35:23.301 --> 35:24.301
Not really.

35:24.501 --> 35:26.421
Big star starts from small roles.

35:26.501 --> 35:27.181
Right?

35:27.421 --> 35:28.421
Right?

35:28.581 --> 35:30.062
You remind me.

35:30.822 --> 35:32.862
I'll look for the alumni book
you gave me.

35:33.062 --> 35:34.942
In a few years,
it could sell for a high price.

35:41.581 --> 35:42.542
I've been competing

35:42.622 --> 35:43.622
and haven't watched it.

35:43.982 --> 35:44.982
No problem.

35:45.181 --> 35:47.102
When the film I star in comes out,

35:47.261 --> 35:49.581
I'll definitely ask you
to write a review.

35:50.902 --> 35:51.461
Miss,

35:51.822 --> 35:52.862
the last two red bean ones

35:52.942 --> 35:54.062
have been bought by him.

35:54.221 --> 35:55.221
You...

35:55.662 --> 35:56.261
No problem.

35:56.461 --> 35:57.461
Give them to her.

35:57.742 --> 35:59.061
That would mean waiting a while.

35:59.141 --> 36:00.141
Taro-flavored one, okay?

36:00.862 --> 36:01.982
No, just the red bean ones.

36:02.141 --> 36:03.261
Alright, here you go.

36:03.461 --> 36:04.622
Then I won't be polite.

36:09.102 --> 36:10.581
Alright, happy New Year.

36:11.501 --> 36:12.022
Bye-bye.

36:12.181 --> 36:13.181
- Bye-bye.
- Bye-bye.

36:21.702 --> 36:22.902
Is it warm? It's hot.

36:22.982 --> 36:23.982
Be careful. It's hot.

36:25.501 --> 36:26.501
Sir, is it okay?

36:31.421 --> 36:32.421
Wait a moment.

36:44.622 --> 36:45.341
Ours are ready.

36:45.421 --> 36:46.141
Have to wait more.

36:46.221 --> 36:47.061
Please hold them.

36:47.141 --> 36:47.742
Thank you.

36:47.902 --> 36:48.902
Pack two more.

36:51.181 --> 36:52.181
Smells good.

36:53.742 --> 36:54.942
It's almost midnight.

36:57.581 --> 36:58.581
I

36:59.181 --> 37:00.381
have something to give you.

37:03.581 --> 37:04.622
What is this?

37:05.261 --> 37:05.863
It

37:05.943 --> 37:07.102
is a safety charm.

37:08.702 --> 37:09.421
In the new year,

37:09.541 --> 37:10.942
you'll make your dreams come true.

37:12.662 --> 37:13.662
Thank you.

37:13.742 --> 37:15.221
I also wish you a happy new year

37:15.301 --> 37:16.301
and achieve your dreams.

37:41.541 --> 37:42.541
Yingying.

37:47.421 --> 37:48.421
What are you doing?

37:49.902 --> 37:51.181
Actually, there are some words

37:51.622 --> 37:52.622
that I've never said.

37:53.181 --> 37:54.023
I originally planned

37:54.103 --> 37:55.822
to tell you after you get to Beijing.

37:56.181 --> 37:58.622
- At that time, you just stay quiet.
- But...

38:07.742 --> 38:09.022
When I go to Beijing,

38:09.822 --> 38:10.822
let me say it.

38:13.214 --> 38:15.470
♪Can beat the night♪

38:15.550 --> 38:19.512
♪We can outrun time♪

38:19.512 --> 38:22.501
♪Let beautiful stories and wishes♪

38:22.581 --> 38:23.581
Yes!

38:25.102 --> 38:27.461
- Happy New Year.
- Happy New Year.

38:27.704 --> 38:29.942
- Happy New Year.
- Happy New Year!

39:19.501 --> 39:20.501
(River Snail Girl,)

39:21.141 --> 39:22.141
(your delivery is here.)

39:52.942 --> 39:53.942
(Thanks,)

39:54.062 --> 39:55.461
(errand boy.)

40:27.541 --> 40:29.022
(Shy Boy Chen,)

40:29.221 --> 40:30.421
(I forgot to remind you.)

40:30.501 --> 40:31.822
(I made the end table myself.)

40:31.902 --> 40:33.181
(Be careful when you use it.)

40:33.421 --> 40:34.862
(It might not be very stable yet.)

40:35.261 --> 40:36.622
(Please don't knock it.)

40:54.181 --> 40:56.421
(By the way, when you have time,)

40:56.501 --> 40:57.622
(nail pictures on the wall.)

40:58.102 --> 41:00.062
(I don't know
if the landlord allows nails,)

41:00.421 --> 41:02.461
(so I just use something to stick them.)

41:10.541 --> 41:11.541
(What did you do?)

41:14.102 --> 41:15.102
(Crack walnuts.)

41:17.141 --> 41:18.181
(Shy Boy Chen,)

41:18.381 --> 41:19.622
(are you crazy?)

41:20.141 --> 41:21.782
(Why crack walnuts during the new year?)

41:23.822 --> 41:25.982
(I'm hungry.)

41:29.902 --> 41:31.782
(Didn't you just go out to eat?)

41:32.221 --> 41:33.221
(The shops are closed.)

41:33.822 --> 41:35.141
(I only bought a few cakes.)

41:43.181 --> 41:44.702
(There are two cans of cat food)

41:44.782 --> 41:46.221
(left in the fridge.)

41:46.381 --> 41:47.461
(Manage for one night.)

41:47.702 --> 41:48.702
(Be good.)

41:57.862 --> 42:00.541
(If you don't love me anymore,
then don't force it.)

42:29.942 --> 42:30.982
How did you know here?

42:31.301 --> 42:32.501
Zhi told me.

42:32.822 --> 42:33.822
Room 903.

42:34.102 --> 42:35.421
When did you two become so close?

42:36.341 --> 42:37.421
Why not ask me directly?

42:38.702 --> 42:39.902
Would you tell me?

42:41.301 --> 42:42.102
Why not go home?

42:42.182 --> 42:43.301
You fought with Dad again?

42:43.862 --> 42:45.141
That house is so big.

42:45.381 --> 42:46.501
It doesn't have atmosphere.

42:46.902 --> 42:48.022
I want to live with you.

42:48.501 --> 42:49.622
It can't accommodate you.

42:50.102 --> 42:50.702
Go home.

42:50.902 --> 42:51.902
Luzhou,

42:53.221 --> 42:54.862
your house isn't small.

42:55.902 --> 42:57.341
Why can't it accommodate me?

42:58.341 --> 42:59.982
I can pay you rent.

43:02.942 --> 43:04.982
Open the door, Luzhou.

43:09.301 --> 43:10.301
Luzhou,

43:10.702 --> 43:11.822
how long has it been since

43:11.902 --> 43:13.102
we last slept in the same bed?

43:14.062 --> 43:15.101
It was probably since

43:15.181 --> 43:17.461
I found out you were wetting the bed
in elementary school.

43:19.702 --> 43:21.501
Luzhou, you have your own place now.

43:22.982 --> 43:24.541
Does it mean you won't go back anymore?

43:29.742 --> 43:30.942
Are you still my brother then?

43:32.982 --> 43:33.982
Don't be pretentious.

43:34.221 --> 43:35.221
Go to sleep.

43:36.381 --> 43:37.421
Why not reply to me?

43:42.702 --> 43:44.782
You've called me brother
ever since you could talk.

43:46.102 --> 43:47.102
That won't change.

43:47.862 --> 43:48.862
Alright then.

43:49.581 --> 43:50.742
Then at that time,

43:51.862 --> 43:52.862
I'll just not go back

43:53.421 --> 43:54.582
and move in to live with you.

43:54.662 --> 43:55.662
You wish.

43:56.301 --> 43:57.541
Go back obediently tomorrow.

43:57.662 --> 43:58.662
Did you hear me?

43:59.221 --> 44:01.301
Your house is big enough.

44:01.782 --> 44:02.782
Why

44:02.942 --> 44:03.982
can't it accommodate me?

44:08.461 --> 44:09.461
Luzhou, don't worry.

44:09.902 --> 44:11.662
I will not disturb you and Zhi.

44:12.022 --> 44:13.462
I can go sleep on the couch.

44:13.542 --> 44:14.982
Shut up and sleep.

44:16.141 --> 44:17.461
Okay.

44:21.581 --> 44:22.581
Tuck yourself in tight.

44:56.022 --> 44:57.702
I heard you came back for vacation.

44:58.822 --> 44:59.822
I just arrived yesterday.

45:00.341 --> 45:01.942
Why didn't you tell me?

45:02.221 --> 45:03.902
It was Xingqi who told me.

45:04.862 --> 45:05.982
He's with me now.

45:06.862 --> 45:07.942
I'll send him back.

45:10.702 --> 45:11.782
Do you want...?

45:12.421 --> 45:14.102
Want to come to my place
for the New Year?

45:14.581 --> 45:15.622
I'll go tomorrow

45:16.062 --> 45:17.062
to pick you up?

45:17.501 --> 45:18.501
No need.

45:22.301 --> 45:23.301
Luzhou,

45:24.782 --> 45:25.782
Happy New Year.

45:27.862 --> 45:30.141
Happy New Year, Mom.

45:31.982 --> 45:32.982
Good night.

46:28.990 --> 46:32.494
(Our College Entrance Examination
scores are door codes.)

46:32.574 --> 46:35.320
(My home only has a place for you.)

46:35.582 --> 46:42.552
(No one else.)

46:43.064 --> 46:48.880
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

46:49.432 --> 46:54.960
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

46:56.472 --> 47:00.920
♪The world is too quiet♪

47:01.912 --> 47:08.840
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

47:09.752 --> 47:14.840
♪Who will visit me♪

47:15.896 --> 47:21.520
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

47:22.264 --> 47:25.320
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

47:25.560 --> 47:30.880
♪Into concern and care♪

47:36.408 --> 47:41.520
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

47:42.040 --> 47:47.880
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

47:49.336 --> 47:52.720
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

47:52.856 --> 47:59.080
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

47:59.576 --> 48:02.520
♪The lonely clock♪

48:02.680 --> 48:07.280
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

48:07.672 --> 48:10.920
♪Are we both♪

48:11.192 --> 48:14.720
♪Attracted to each other♪

48:15.864 --> 48:22.480
♪Falling into you♪

48:26.200 --> 48:32.000
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

48:32.856 --> 48:35.520
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

48:36.056 --> 48:40.680
♪From reaching eternity♪

48:41.080 --> 48:44.360
♪After rushing recklessly♪

48:44.568 --> 48:48.000
♪We approach each other♪

48:49.272 --> 48:52.880
♪Without turning back♪

48:54.264 --> 49:01.920
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

49:02.552 --> 49:09.040
♪Falling into you♪
